<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;">slop98-inorganic-thermofun.json     cached        https://github.com/thermohub/thermohub/tree/v1.1.1/thermofun (archive: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7385311)</span></span>
